   "end": 123.9
  },
  {
   "text": "And then, basically, all of us, and supporting partners and every company and every speaker, who made it possible.",
   "start": 123.96,
   "end": 130.68
  },
  {
   "text": "Thank you, thank you, thank you.",
   "start": 130.74,
   "end": 132.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Now a couple of words how my day went.",
   "start": 132.72,
   "end": 137.4
  },
  {
   "text": "I spent the day talking to our speakers and participants, and what I noticed is that one of the strongest incentives to come to this conference is hiring.",
   "start": 137.46,
   "end": 148.14
  },
  {
   "text": "To the point that even some speakers are hiring and also looking for work.",
   "start": 148.2,
   "end": 155.7
  },
  {
   "text": "So... I have a little idea for you about how to benefit the most from this amazing conference and make sure the phonetic financial part gets some local attention to.",
   "start": 155.76,
   "end": 169.02
  },
  {
   "text": "So I suggest you build an agent that takes the conference program and makes a list of all these speakers and their companies.",
   "start": 169.08,
