  },
  {
   "text": "Then you right now yourself based on whose work and time you found the most interesting and who you would actually like to work with.",
   "start": 179.64,
   "end": 187.8
  },
  {
   "text": "The next step is to sell your agent to those companies for your saves, right?",
   "start": 187.92,
   "end": 193.08
  },
  {
   "text": "And find them open positions to match them to your experience and collect the published compensation rate rages.",
   "start": 193.14,
   "end": 201.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Then, look at your idea, and if the celebrate changes your mind and changes your rating, that's fine.",
   "start": 201.18,
   "end": 209.34
  },
  {
   "text": "You are updating your beliefs based on the evidence.",
   "start": 209.4,
   "end": 212.64
  },
  {
   "text": "So, now, while you still here, I encourage you to go and find the people you would really like to work with all meat.",
   "start": 212.7,
   "end": 221.82
  },
  {
   "text": "And talk to them because you've heard their thoughts and you know something about their work and that would be just such a good conversation start.",
   "start": 221.88,
   "end": 230.7
  },
  {
   "text": "And please don't make your agents send out your resume automatically.",
   "start": 231.18,
   "end": 238.14
  },
  {
   "text": "That's basically that Carmenau.",
